# Canonical identity for the maintainer. History carries three forms of it, none rewritten:
# an address git derived where user.email was unset ("Geoff.E.Miller@gmail", no ".com"), and a
# <user>@<hostname> address from a worker run under a private HOME (docs/guides/agent-waves.md).
# Matching is by address alone, so any display name on these addresses maps too. Real third-party
# identities get no line here.
